  m_Time: 36.3
  action: 0
  speaker: "NH\xC2N V\u1EACT"
  line: "Ta \u0111\xE3 h\u1EE7y di\u1EC7t ng\xF4i l\xE0ng, x\xF3a \u0111i nh\u1EEFng
    ng\u01B0\u1EDDi t\u1EEBng tin t\u01B0\u1EDFng ta\u2026 ch\u1EC9 v\xEC tin r\u1EB1ng
    \u1EDF cu\u1ED1i con \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng n\xE0y, ta s\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
    t\u1EF1 do."
  variant: 0
--- !u!114 &2665532075816560552
