  action: 0
  speaker: "NH\xC2N V\u1EACT"
  line: "Nh\xE0 t\xF9 c\u1EE7a ta l\xE0 m\u1ED9t k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3 \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
